2 个迁移、类型与事务清单\n- [x] R0C：本机 / WSL / TEST 版本、测试及发布入口盘点\n- [x] R0D：ADR-018、迁移计划、R0 与 R1 基线草案\n- [x] R0E：Debian 12 构建、固定 Rust 依赖、隔离 PG15.12 与合成验收\n- [x] R0F：39 个缺路由记录及 7 个参数名差异的显式裁决\n- [x] R0F：认证、错误、日期、金额等可复算兼容样本\n- [x] R0F：逐路由 / 逐表的 R1 子切片输入与验证矩阵\n- [x] GitHub 映射、非作者审查、文档与工具检查、提交及 G4 归档\n\n边界：本任务不实现 R1 产品代码，不改变既有业务 API / DTO / OpenAPI / migration，不写原 PG17 或 TEST，不执行发布或性能测试。PG17 用于日常开发测试，隔离 PG15 用于 TEST 兼容验收。\n\nR0F 交付 `711e61116a7c00b0378702cabfc4e4d232beee3b`；生命周期已归档。R1 输入 G1 Pass，工程 #60 Todo；总体 #57 与后续域路由 #61 保持打开。此完成状态只认证迁移输入准备，不认证 Rust 产品实现或完整真实集成。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/58/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/58/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub reposit