ttps://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/19f837c9e33fe9cdeb7ca94f3c932c9621cb91d3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r1-foundation-baseline.md)、R0F 路由/数据/认证兼容文档，以及 R0E 固定构建镜像、依赖锁和隔离 PG15.12 环境。\n\n- [x] R1A #62：Rust 工程、配置/日志/错误、启停、SQLx 时区及真实事务/取消/回滚\n- [x] R1B #63：共享类型单向导出、日期/金额/ID/状态/权限与 JSON 兼容，不维护第二套权威值\n- [x] R1C #64：认证、Cookie/CSRF/session/default-deny/敏感字段/密文及最小审计；双向会话和真实 PG15 负面/并发验证\n- [x] R1D #65：managed-nest/managed-rust/external API E2E、跨平台浏览器启动和完整客户端生成\n- [x] R1E #66：七操作支持的认证 UI 与阶段集成、真实浏览器、非作者审查、各子项 G3/G4 及生命周期归档\n\n提交证据按子切片保留，不将历史运行计为本轮重跑：\n\n- R1A：实现 `51572db5`；归档 `ef9fd7f4`；37 项非 DB、8 项真实 PG15、78 项进程断言。\n- R1B：实现 `5cc44100`；归档 `1013afef`；56 项 Rust tests 中含 37 项 R1A 回归。\n- R1C：实现 `69ab8ac8`；归档 `e951b76b`；Rust 1.99.1，81 普通测试、20 真实 DB、29×2 HTTP / 558 断言及 78 进程断言。\n- R1D：实现 `c14333d5`；归档 `70482a77`；原 Nest 72、七组 foundation 各 13、四组 Chromium、双平台各 47 生命周期及完整 579 文件生成一致。\n- R1E：实现 `afbf4ee51baa8543981e66472d04a4d7389a9adb`；归档 `19f837c9e33fe9cdeb7ca94f3c932c9621cb91d3`；四组合 stage 各 16 / 共 64，零 skip/flaky/retry；本轮 Nest API 72、foundation 四组合各 13、legacy 36（11 项 route-mock 仅计 Nest 回归）、完整 client 579 文件集合/逐文件 SHA 一致；80 个唯一 run（最终 64 个与首轮 16 个）再次清理全通过。35 项最终 / 73 项继承源码匹配，合入后 19 项适配器检查通过，C 独立审查无剩余 P1/P2。\n\n[R1E 基线](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/19f837c9e33fe9cdeb7ca94f3c932c9621cb91d3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r1e-stage-acceptance-baseline.md)、[纠偏记录](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/19f837c9e33fe9cdeb7ca94f3c932c9621cb91d3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r1e-corrective-checkpoint.md)与本总体基线三份生命周期文件均已归档；[机器验收](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/19f837c9e33fe9cdeb7ca94f3c932c9621cb91d3/docs/design/rust-r1e-validation.json)保留实际 UI/拦截器/固定测试桥分层、失败历史和源码快照。原始证据保存：700 个文件、93,910,462 bytes 已复制至本地 `/home/wangzishi/.local/share/poms-r1e/evidence/r1e-final-windows`，复制前后及最终文件集合、逐文件 SHA-256 全部一致；该目录保留日志、Playwright 报告/截图与验收前端产物；清单 SHA-256：`2e91b24f48c5e57f7e2fad75120e743d573bbf255b03fd1bb8fe4d28b1735179`。\n\n不含完整平台/审批/附件/外部 provider/客户合同资金提成、迁移接管或正式切换。Rust R2 真实 404、PrimeUI 许可提示、Nest 组织 create 201 / OpenAPI 200 差异均保留，不宣称完整业务 UI、部署或性能改善完成。#61 的两个业务号 lookup 裁决仍归后续域，未修改。PG17 继续日常使用，本轮仅查询其服务元数据，未执行 SQL 或变更；专用 PG15 用于 TEST 兼容验收。总体 #57 保持 Open，R2–R7 未完成；下游开工仍须独立冻结 G1。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/60/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/60/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61","id":6029353558,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABZ2CiVg","number":61,"title":"[RUST-ROUTE] 收口 R2–R4 查询与参数命名裁决","user":{"login":"wangzishi","id":8288105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODgxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8288105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi","html_url":"https://github.com/wangzishi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/rec