om/repos/illusion-tech/poms/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/deployments","created_at":"2026-03-22T07:28:06Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:28:32Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-03T04:28:28Z","git_url":"git://github.com/illusion-tech/poms.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:illusion-tech/poms.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms","homepage":null,"size":102880,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":5,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"父任务：#57。状态：Done / G4 Pass；本项六条件和原生 #82/#83/#84 全部完成后收口，仅路由与参数治理完成。\n\n\n### 本轮当前路由裁决收口与 G4（实际 G4）\n\n项目/合同两业务号 lookup 已完成正式 identity/query/canonical/DTO/错误/审计裁决及直接切换；两项纯路径使用必填 query，controller/OpenAPI/原 client/consumer/测试已同步，无额外 alias。此前 K 五参数 #82 与 R4 两参数 #83 的原交付记录保留。\n\n**关闭条件已逐项复核：本项自身六条件全部完成，原生子项 #82、#83、#84 均 Closed/completed。** 实际关闭前的最新 API 回执单独保留；正文或子项之一不能替代另一条件。\n\n- 实现固定提交：[3b154bf447df9897a934e95cb218fbdb0beaba47](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/3b154bf447df9897a934e95cb218fbdb0beaba47)，已实际集成并推送 main。\n- 归档固定提交：[3f76064319094f1e61207b2f7008f226c30fa869](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/3f76064319094f1e61207b2f7008f226c30fa869)，生命周期原件及映射已完成归档。\n- [非作者 G3 与固定提交复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/3f76064319094f1e61207b2f7008f226c30fa869/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r2l-g3-checkpoint.md)；[机器验收](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/3f76064319094f1e61207b2f7008f226c30fa869/docs/design/rust-r2l-validation.json)；[完整保全](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/3f76064319094f1e61207b2f7008f226c30fa869/docs/design/rust-r2l-preservation.json)；[归档与 G4 收口](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/3f76064319094f1e61207b2f7008f226c30fa869/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r2l-closeout.md)。\n\n本项仅路由/参数治理完成，新增 Rust R3/R4 业务 0，不代表完整合同/移交域、整个 R2 或 Rust 迁移完成。R2 公开操作 108/108 由 L #79 的独立交付计数；R2M #80 与父 #67/#57 保持 Open。\n\n以下原正文保留原先冻结、历史验收和计数时点；其中 99/104、旧 Todo、旧路由候选和早期 provider/todo 观察均不是本轮现状。当前状态以首行、本段及原生 Issue 状态为准；本轮只关闭已满足自身条件的 #79/#84/#61，#80/#67/#57 保持 Open。\n\n\nR0F 已把两个当前业务号 lookup 记录为 `canonical-decision-pending`，现行实现仍保持：`GET /api/projects/code/{projectNo}`、`GET /api/contracts/no/{contractNo}`。正式输入为 ADR-015、canonical inventory 与 `docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r0f-route-baseline.md`；具体当前路径以该基线和现行 OpenAPI 为准。\n\n- [x] R3 前裁决项目业务号 lookup 的正式查询路径/身份语义、DTO/错误与审计边界\n- [x] R4 前裁决合同业务号 lookup 的正式查询路径/身份语义、DTO/错误与审计边界\n- [x] 更新 authoritative canonical 行并通过独立审查，再实施对应路径\n- [x] 按 ADR-015 直接切换策略验证 controller/OpenAPI/client/测试一致性，不自行添加 alias\n- [x] R2 附件域的五个参数名差异：逐项裁决 canonical id 与现行 handoverId/packageId，并同步绑定参数、OpenAPI/client/测试边界\n- [x] R4 移交域的两个参数名差异：逐项裁决 canonical id 与现行 handoverId；裁决前保留当前运行契约，不把同形 URL 当作参数契约相同\n\n这不是现有运行时修复请求。R0F 只登记并明确后续门槛；该R0F初始登记不预先猜定新URL。2026-10-29用户续授权#82的K五项参数裁决及必要契约同步，范围按已冻结G1；其余R3/R4项不因此获实现授权，产品DDL不变。\n\n\n已完成子片：#82，G4 Pass；当前范围与证据见 docs/design/rust-r2l1-g4-closeout.md。其余父项checklist保持未完成，本批0新增已交付公共操作。\n\n2026-10-29子片收口：#82已按独立G3、main 894fc72c2a90f0c93988ad23bcfe87157bdc322d、固定提交复核和归档完成。仅K五项参数改用{id}并同步真实绑定/完整spec/原生成client/四consumer，其他四项差异不变；#78 K业务仍Todo。 R2仍99/108。\n\n\n2026-10-30 当前参数收口：#83 已完成两项{id}绑定/spec/client同步、S2永久祖先、非作者G3/固定提交及生命周期归档。RUST-R2K-R4-G4/33882f3f。仅两个参数组完成，两业务号lookup及对应路径/身份裁决继续未完成；本父任务保持Open，Rust R4业务未因此迁移。\n\n\n### 2026-10-30 新批次 G0\n\n用户明确授权完整G0–G4：L四操作及必要真实合同/提成处理器、待办关联事实，与[两业务号lookup子片](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/84)并行。来源main 02b8956759352b2612bec5980cbe55ae77d0293f，分支 codex/poms-r2l-lookup；先联合G1，再实现。原L1七表与同事务callback已交付，但final/retention的中途flush/双snapshot等真实写链须本片冻结并校准；不等待整个R3–R5，也不冒称它们整体完成。当前R2为104/108，只有四L完整G4可108/108，R2M与父#67/#57继续待验。#61仅所有自身lookup/canonical/直接切换条件实际完成后才可关闭。\n\n\n本条固定归档链接记录在线回写前的准备版本；当前实际 G4 以本条、同次在线回执及后续 main 元数据增量为准。历史冻结验收、首次副本失败和四项 Rust SQL wire 覆盖边界均不回写。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/61/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/67","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/67/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/67/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/67/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/67","id":6034398830,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABZ62ebg","number":67,"title":"[RUST-R2] 迁移平台与公共能力","u