B保全、运行对象/API/browser/PG/keepalive为0，保留卷/private。E1五别名退出且双端支持回放一致。\n\n[独立G3](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/4b078edfbf47cbc7901e0929c98fa6c726b20ef3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3m/C/g3-independent-review01.json)、[固定提交](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/4b078edfbf47cbc7901e0929c98fa6c726b20ef3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3m/C/fixed-commit-review01.json)、[main读回](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/4b078edfbf47cbc7901e0929c98fa6c726b20ef3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3m/main-integration-proof01.json)、[原字节映射](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/4b078edfbf47cbc7901e0929c98fa6c726b20ef3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3m/archive-origin-map.json)、[阶段证据](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/4b078edfbf47cbc7901e0929c98fa6c726b20ef3/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3m/g3-package-manifest01.json)。\n\n历史failed/partial/quarantine/ignored原标签保留；原G1/G3候选Pending字段不回写。R3审批仅Lead人工覆盖，合同R4/佣金R5及R4–R7各自后续推进。Windows浏览器连Linux Rust不代表Windows原生Rust；未认领部署、切流或性能认证。总体#57保持OPEN。三作者工作树被应用活动任务引用，22ignored原件已保全，未强制归档或终止其他任务；这不是验收运行态残留。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/85/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/85/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101","id":6176489870,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABcCXBjg","number":101,"title":"[RUST-R4] 合同资金与项目执行阶段迁移","user":{"login":"wang